  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Given, the system of equations</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>&#946;</mi></math></p><p>Now finding,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#9651;</mo><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mi>&#945;</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>3</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>5</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#9651;</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mfenced><mrow><mn>10</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>&#945;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>&#945;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#9651;</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#945;</mi></math></p><p>Now for unique solution,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#9651;</mo><mo>&#8800;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>&#8800;</mo><mn>3</mn></math></p><p>So, for unique solution&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>&#8800;</mo><mn>3</mn></math></p><p>But in option&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi>D</mi></mfenced></math>, system has unique solution for&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math>&nbsp;which is completely wrong.</p></blockquote>"
